OL,3,ANurse stole #750k from 99-year-old
OL,4,Awoman for cosmetic surgery and home
OL,5,Aimprovements
OL,6,
OL,7,FA nurse who stole #750,000 from a
OL,8,Fvulnerable 99-year-old and spent the
OL,9,Fmoney on cosmetic surgery and home
OL,10,Fimprovements has been struck off.
OL,12,FRebecca Louise Burwood exploited the
OL,13,Fresident who was living at Bryn Yr Haul
OL,14,FCare Home in Mold, Flintshire, where
OL,15,Fshe was deputy manager, for her own
OL,16,Fpersonal and financial gain.
OL,18,FShe coerced the pensioner from 2017 to
OL,19,F2023 and also bought a car and
OL,20,Fcampervan with the stolen money, as
OL,21,Fwell as obtaining ownership of the
OL,22,Fwoman's home.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
