OL,3,AOregon teacher fought school attacker
OL,4,Abefore armed dad shot suspect 'multiple
OL,5,Atimes'
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome readers may find this article
OL,8,Fdistressing.
OL,10,FAn Oregon teacher threw her mobile
OL,11,Fphone before she tackled and tried to
OL,12,Fwrestle away a shotgun from the arms of
OL,13,Fa teen suspect who opened fire on a
OL,14,Fspecial educational needs class.
OL,16,FAs she tussled with him on the floor of
OL,17,Fthe class - where three children and a
OL,18,Fteacher were killed - a bystander armed
OL,19,Fwith a pistol ran inside and killed the
OL,20,Fteen.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
