OL,3,ATrump waives several Russia sanctions
OL,4,Aas new US law takes effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has used his
OL,7,Fpresidential authority to block
OL,8,Fnumerous sanctions on Russia that were
OL,9,Frecently passed by the US Congress in
OL,10,Fan effort to punish the country for its
OL,11,Fwar on Ukraine.
OL,13,FIn an executive order on Friday night,
OL,14,FTrump said that it is in the US
OL,15,F"national interests" to withhold some
OL,16,Fof the sanctions. Trump signed the
OL,17,Fsanctions bill into law in September,
OL,18,Fand it was due to take effect on
OL,19,FSunday.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
